hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"129","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Mujhe un ke sath hidayat de jinhein Tune hidayat di; mujhe un ke sath aafiyat de jinhein Tune aafiyat di; mujhe un ke sath apna dost bana jinhein Tune dost banaya; mujhe jo diya us mein barkat de; apne faisle ke shar se mujhe bacha; beshak Tu faisla karta hai, Tujh par faisla nahin hota; jise Tu dost banae woh zaleel nahin hota, jise Tu dushman rakhe woh azeez nahin hota; Tu babarkat aur buland hai, ae hamare Rab. [Witr mein qunut ki dua]"
"130","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Tere ghazab se teri raza ki, teri saza se tere maaf karne ki panah chahta hun; Tujhse teri hi panah chahta hun; teri tareef gin nahin sakta; Tu waisa hi hai jaisi Tune apni tareef ki. [Witr ke sajde mein padhe]"
"131","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Hum teri hi ibadat karte hain, tere liye namaz padhte aur sajda karte hain, teri taraf daudte aur khidmat karte hain; teri rahmat ki ummeed rakhte hain, tere azab se darte hain; beshak tera azab kafiron ko pahunchne wala hai. Ae Allah! Hum Tujhse madad mangte hain, Tujhse maghfirat mangte hain, teri khub tareef karte hain, teri nashukri nahin karte, Tujh par iman late hain, tere aage jhukte hain, aur jo tera inkar kare us se alag hote hain. [Witr mein qunut ki dua]"
